#VRML V2.0 utf8
# Project-authored standards fixture (oracle/standards/README.md).
# Clause numbers are those of the Web3D free copy of ISO/IEC 14772-1:1997; equality with the ISO text UNVERIFIED.
# 6.25 Inline: the url field names a VRML file of children nodes, which become the Inline's children.
# 4.5.3 item 3: the relative URL resolves against this file.
DEF Basic Inline {
  url "basic-child.wrl"
  bboxCenter 0 0 0
  bboxSize 2 2 2
}
